'''Type of Feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Archmage]] level 1

'''Specifics''': The [[Archmage]] can alter an [[arcane]] spell when cast so that it utilizes a different element from the one it normally uses. This ability can only alter a spell with the [[Acid damage|acid]], [[Cold damage|cold]], [[Fire damage|fire]], [[Electrical damage|electricity]], or [[Sonic damage|sonic]] descriptor. 

'''Use''': Selected.

==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].
*The feat to set them back to normal is free at level 1, the [[Acid damage|acid]], [[Cold damage|cold]], [[Fire damage|fire]], [[Electrical damage|electricity]], and [[Sonic damage|sonic]] damages are separated in their own feats and must be selected. 

